    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "aya, piyux balay lpyung nyux mwah ngasal ryax soni!",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66119/923458",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ryax soni ga pkekong qu qbsuyan mlikuy. nanu yasa qu piyux squliq mwah.",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66119/923459",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "mqas balay wah ! bsyaq balay ini ktay lha la!",
                "textCh": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
